SUMMARY:The Fog City Swampers
DESCRIPTION:Preserve Presents: Winters Live Music Series at Winters Opera House \nJoin us for an unforgettable evening with the Winters Live music series\, a collaboration between Preserve and Winters Live\, hosted at the stunning Winters Opera House. \nThe Swampers CCR Tribute is a female-fronted homage to one of the most loved and iconic bands to ever come out of the Bay Area: Creedence Clearwater Revival. The show features all of CCR’s smash hits as well as a few hidden gems. The CCR catalog boasts some of the very best of American Rock and Roll\, and  John Fogerty’s masterful storytelling still resonates with and inspires audiences worldwide. \nShow starts at 7:30PM\, enjoy happy house at Preserve 6:30-7:30PM \nTickets are $45\, to purchase click here.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/the-fog-city-swampers/
LOCATION:Winters Opera House\, 13 Main Street\, Winters\, 95694\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/jefferson-santos-fCEJGBzAkrU-unsplash-2-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
